<body>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/fraction_model.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>

<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 24 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">異分母FractionSubtraction + 加減混合</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">通分後相減 · 加減混合運算 · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4下B冊 單元四<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 分子夠唔夠減？· 帶Fraction借位 · 加減混合次序搞錯<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> 呈分試計算題核心，Fraction四則基礎<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L22 通分/LCM · L23 異分母Addition · 整數Subtraction借位<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 異分母FractionSubtraction步驟 ❷ 帶FractionSubtraction（含借位）❸ Fraction加減混合 ❹ 答案約至最簡
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🍕 分數大作戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">通分、約分、四則混合！避開分母陷阱。連續答對分數翻倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> = ？（同分母，直接減！）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:38px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>LCM(4, 6) = ？（用於通分）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:38px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = ？（複習Addition）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>2 - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = ？（整數減Fraction，要點做？）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = ？分子 1 夠唔夠減 3？（唔夠！要借位！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：異分母FractionSubtraction三步法 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>Step 1 — 通分：</b>搵LCM做公分母，擴分到相同分母<br/>
      ② <b>Step 2 — 分子相減：</b>分母相同後，分子相減，分母保持不變！<br/>
      ③ <b>Step 3 — 約至最簡：</b>答案約至最簡，假Fraction轉帶Fraction<br/>
      ④ <b>注意：</b>同分母加減嘅步驟完全一樣——只係加變成減！
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> = ？（LCM=12 → 9/12 - 2/12 = 7/12）</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> = ？LCM=24</div></div>
<div class="kc">
<div class="kc-w"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap：分子相減·分母相減</div><div class="eq">5/6 - 3/8 → (5-3)/(6-8) ❌<br/>分母減分母係錯嘅！6-8=-2冇意義</div></div>
<div class="kc-r"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確：先通分母，只減分子</div><div class="eq">LCM=24 → 20/24 - 9/24<br/>= 11/24 ✅</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：帶FractionSubtraction — 借位Trap <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考！</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>Fraction部分夠減：</b>整數減整數，Fraction減Fraction（Fraction部分先通分）<br/>
        例：3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> = (3-1)+(<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span>-<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span>) = 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span><br/>
      ② <b>Fraction部分唔夠減 → 要借位！</b>從整數借 1 = 分母/分母<br/>
        例：3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span><br/>
        借位詳解：3又1/4 = 2 + 1又1/4 = 2 + 5/4 → Fraction部分變成 5/4 夠減 3/4！
    </div>
</div>
<div class="big-warn">
<div class="bw-title">⚠️ 借位Trap：60% 學生會錯！</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:700;margin:6px 0;">
      3又1/4 - 1又3/4 → 唔夠減唔識借位 → 錯寫成 2又(-2)/4 或乾脆放棄
    </div>
<div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--green);font-weight:700;">
      正確：從 3 借 1 → 變成 2又5/4 → 5/4 - 3/4 = 2/4 = 1/2 → 答案 1又1/2
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> = ？（Fraction部分：2/5 唔夠減 3/5 → 借位！）</div></div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：Fraction加減混合運算 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>由左至右：</b>Fraction加減混合跟整數一樣，由左至右逐個計<br/>
      ② <b>三個Fraction加減：</b>可以先全部通分到同一個LCM → 分子加加減減 → 約簡<br/>
      ③ <b>帶Fraction混合：</b>可先轉假Fraction再通分，或分開整數和Fraction部分處理
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例4</div><div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> = ？LCM(4,2,3)=12</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 加減次序Trap：唔係「邊個大就先減邊個」！由左至右逐個計。3/4 + 1/2 - 1/3 = (3/4+1/2) - 1/3，唔係 3/4 + (1/2-1/3)（答案一樣但概念要對）。</div>
<div class="lf-kp" style="margin-top:12px;">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：整數減Fraction <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🟡 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① 整數 = 分母/分母 嘅假Fraction。例：1 = <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">4</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">6</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span><br/>
      ② 整數減Fraction：將整數化成同分母的假Fraction再減<br/>
        例：1 - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例5</div><div class="lf-ex-q">3 - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一至四 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> = ？（唔夠減，要借位）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> = ？LCM(4,5,2)=20</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（All Must Complete，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">10</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> = ？（Fraction部分夠減）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（🚶🚀 Optional，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> = ？（借位！1/3 唔夠減 2/3）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>1 - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> = ？（整數減Fraction）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> = ？（Fraction部分要通分，LCM=12）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（🚀 Optional，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>4<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> - 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = ？（通分+借位，LCM=12）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:62px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">7</span><span class="fn">12</span></span></span> = ？（LCM=12，一次過通分）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> + 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">10</span></span></span> - 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">7</span><span class="fn">10</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🏔️ 終極挑戰（🚀 Optional，共 1 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>5 - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = ？（提示：全轉假Fraction→通分LCM=12→計分→轉回帶Fraction）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、Word Problems （12 min）（SSPA 文字題，共 5 題）</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例6</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一桶油有 5<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 升，用了 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> 升。剩下多少升？</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>一條絲帶長 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">7</span><span class="fn">8</span></span></span> 米，剪去 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 米。剩下幾米？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>小明有 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> 個薄餅，分咗 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> 個俾妹妹。自己剩幾多？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>爸爸有 3 小時，用了 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> 小時開車，再用 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> 小時食飯。剩下多少小時？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>三個桶共有水 4 升。第一桶 <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 升、第二桶 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> 升。第三桶 = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>一條路長 5<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> km。行咗 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> km 之後休息，之後再行 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> km。剩下幾km未行？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:62px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">4</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">5</span></span></span> = ？（借位）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>1 - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">7</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td><span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> - <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)（共 3 題，🚀 Optional）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>3<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> = ？（通分+借位，LCM=12）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">2</span></span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">3</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> - 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>一條布長 6<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">2</span><span class="fn">3</span></span></span> 米。第一日用咗 2<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">1</span><span class="fn">4</span></span></span> 米，第二日用咗 1<span class="f"><span class="fd"><span class="fi">5</span><span class="fn">6</span></span></span> 米。剩下幾米？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error（❌ Trap）</th><th>Correct Approach（✅）</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><b>分子減分母減</b>：3/4-1/6=(3-1)/(4-6) ❌</td><td>先通分！分母相同只減分子：9/12-2/12=7/12</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><b>帶Fraction唔夠減唔識借位</b></td><td>從整數借1→化成分母/分母加返上Fraction部分</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><b>借位方向錯</b>：借1變成分子+1（❌）</td><td>借1=分母/分母，例：借1=5/5→加返上原分子</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><b>整數減Fraction</b>當成 1-分子（❌）</td><td>1=分母/分母 嘅假Fraction。1-2/5=5/5-2/5=3/5</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><b>加減混合次序錯</b></td><td>由左至右！或者全通分到LCM→分子加減→約簡</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><b>減完冇約簡</b></td><td>答案檢查：分子分母有冇公Factor。6/8→3/4</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><b>帶FractionSubtraction忘記通分</b>Fraction部分</td><td>Fraction部分都要通分！整數部分可直接減</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「異分母Subtraction同Addition，先通分後減分子。借位要借分母之數，減完約簡先收工。」</div>
<div class="mn" style="margin-top:4px;">🧠 借位Mnemonic：「Fraction唔夠減，整數借個1。一化成同分母，加返Fraction再開波。」</div>
<div class="lf-h1">七、4-Step Problem Solving</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">1</div><div class="stitle">通分</div><div class="sdetail">搵LCM → 每個Fraction擴分到公分母。加減都要先通分！</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">2</div><div class="stitle">睇夠唔夠減</div><div class="sdetail">分子夠減 → 直接減。唔夠減 → 借位：整數-1，Fraction+分母</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">3</div><div class="stitle">分子運算</div><div class="sdetail">分母相同→分子相加減。分母保持不變！由左至右</div></div>
<div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">4</div><div class="stitle">約簡驗收</div><div class="sdetail">約至最簡→假分轉帶分→檢查答案合理性→完成！</div></div>
</div>
